factcheck by anthropic/claude-haiku-5-5: 5 problems
  The reel_script says 'சரவணன்-தீபிகா தம்பதியரின் மகன்' (the student is the son of Saravanan-Deepika) which matches the article, but the slides_spec line 'விசைத்தறித் தொழிலாளி சரவணன்-தீபிகா மகன்' is acceptable; however the reel_script omits the two-son detail (Sabarinathan and Likith) — not an error. The main issue: the reel_script says the 1,330 kurals were recited 'மனப்பாடமாக' and the award was given by the minister, which matches; the caption and reel_script state the minister 'ராஜ்மோகன்' is of 'பள்ளிக் கல்வித் துறை', matching the article.
  The tamil_headline says 'ஊர்வல வரவேற்பு' (procession welcome), while the article describes the students being taken in a procession by scholars; the headline wording 'ஊர்வல வரவேற்பு' is a reasonable rendering, so no clear factual error.
  The reel_script says the achievement was done 'குமாரபாளையத்தில்' (in Kumarapalayam), but the article says the competition was a state-level event held by the Tamil Nadu government; the location of the competition itself is not stated in the article, so placing the achievement in Kumarapalayam is a misattribution — the procession happened in Kumarapalayam, not the recital.
  The reel_script's opening line 'குமாரபாளையத்தில் 1,330 திருக்குறள்களை மனப்பாடமாக ஒப்பித்த மாணவருக்கு ஊர்வல வரவேற்பு' conflates the place of the recital with the place of the procession, mixing two facts into one sentence.
